# ============================================================
# CBH repo .gitignore — keep code + configs + small results;
# exclude multi-GB rasters, raw NFI data, and scratch.
# Bulky inputs live in the data archive (F:\CBH); see rules/reproducibility.md.
# ============================================================

# --- Large rasters / geodata (tens of GB) ---
*.tif
*.tif.ovr
*.tif.aux.xml
*.tfw
*.gdb/
*.img

# --- Raw / large tabular data ---
# Root data/ only (NOT test/data/, which holds shippable reference tables). Anchored with leading slash.
/data/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.mdb
*.parquet
# Non-redistributable NFI-derived cleaned input that lives under test/data/ (license: not shareable)
test/data/NFI-Integrated*.csv
test/data/NFI*cleaned*.csv

# --- Map outputs (regenerate via mapping stage) ---
result/**/*.tif
result/CBH_meter.tif
result/CR.tif

# --- Large regenerable per-tree prediction dumps (keep small metric tables like Evaluation_*.csv) ---
*combined*.csv
*Hybrid-Results*.csv
*SampledImsang*.csv

# --- Large logs ---
src/log*.txt
*.log

# --- Office / binary docs ---
*.pptx
*.doc
*.docx
*.hwp
*.pdf

# --- Build artifacts / packaged bundles (regenerate; don't commit to the code repo) ---
*.zip

# --- Notebook / Python scratch ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.virtual_documents/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
Untitled*.ipynb
*temp*.ipynb
*-temp.ipynb

# --- Excel lock files ---
~$*

# --- Internal Claude / agent-team working files (kept local, not published) ---
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
memory/
TASKS.md

# --- Editor / IDE workspace scratch ---
*.code-workspace

# --- Secrets ---
.env
*NOTION_TOKEN*
.claude/settings.local.json
wp_b4_run.log
log_Prediction.txt
